Subject: [PATCH 04/11] perf(web): serve gallery + swatch photos via next/image
 (AVIF/WebP, blur, lazy)

Replaced the 3 raw <img> tags (the only ones in app/) with next/image fill.
next.config already declares AVIF/WebP formats and Unsplash/Supabase/Blob
remotePatterns, so this activates automatic modern-format delivery and
responsive srcset for every photo. Details:
- Shared lib/image.ts: one warm blur placeholder (fade-in, reserves paint =
  no CLS) and responsive sizes presets, so all photos load identically.
- Gallery: priority on the first tile only, lazy for the rest; correct sizes
  per column span. Deck cards: fill + deck sizes.
- Swatch: fill inside the 68px box (added position:relative); still opt-in via
  the photo prop, drawn tone otherwise.
Type-checks clean; no raw <img> remains.
